## 5. Key Findings

- No fully duplicated rows were identified.
- 2,370 missing received dates were found in cancelled purchase orders.
- Repeated IDs were identified in invoices and payments.
- Nine foreign key relationships were checked successfully, with zero unmatched records.
- Warehouse capacity was converted into a numeric format.
- Product dimensions and volume were calculated.

